    "contentMarkdown": "# Модель ядра (Core Model)\n\nМодель Core Model — це метод Аре Галланда (Are Halland) для проєктування сторінок або цифрового досвіду на перетині завдань користувача та цілей бізнесу. Вона поєднує необхідний людям контент із вхідними шляхами, якими вони туди потрапляють, та релевантними наступними діями (forward paths), які вони можуть зробити.\n\n## What does a core model contain?\n\nChoose a core page and record its user tasks, business goals, inward paths, core content, and forward paths. These fields help a team decide what the experience must support before working on its layout.\n\n## Example: A hotel room detail page\n\n| Core Model field | Example |\n|---|---|\n| Core page | Details for a family room. |\n| User tasks | Check capacity, bed arrangements, cancellation terms, and availability for the intended dates. |\n| Business goals | Help travelers choose a suitable room and complete a booking. |\n| Inward paths | A room search result, a saved link, or a search-engine result. |\n| Core content | Room capacity, bed types, photos, applicable terms, and availability and price for selected dates. |\n| Forward paths | Select dates, book the room, compare another room, or ask a question. |\n\nA traveler entering from a saved link needs enough context to identify the room and select dates. Someone arriving from dated search results expects the price and availability to match those dates. The model makes these entry conditions explicit.\n\n## How do you use the Core Model?\n\nDevelop the model with people responsible for user research, content, product, and business outcomes. Use research to establish user tasks, then sketch how the page can support them and the intended next steps.\n\nTest the proposed experience through realistic entry paths. Can a traveler confirm the room fits their party and find the applicable cancellation terms? Can they proceed with their chosen dates? Revisit the model when the test reveals missing information or an onward path that interrupts the task.\n\n## Пов'язані терміни\n\n- [Information Architecture (IA)](/ua/glossary/information-architecture.html)\n- [Wayfinding System](/ua/glossary/wayfinding-system.html)\n- [Conversion Funnel](/ua/glossary/conversion-funnel-architecture.html)\n- [Jobs to Be Done (JTBD)](/ua/glossary/jobs-to-be-done-jtbd.html)\n\n## Джерела\n\n- [The Core Model, Are Halland](https://www.thecoremodel.com/)\n- [The Core Model: Designing Inside Out for Better Results, Ida Aalen / A List Apart](https://alistapart.com/article/the-core-model-designing-inside-out-for-better-results/)\n- [JTBD and the Core Model, Are Halland](https://www.thecoremodel.com/jtbd/)",
